	'messages:move-page' => 'szy:milimad $1',
	'messages:move-page-legend' => 'szy:milimad kasabelih',
	'messages:movepagetext' => 'szy:isasa’ay a aazihan cudad kapah sapihica miliyaw pangangan cacay kasabelih, atu milimad mikabu kya kasabelih a sacahamin nazipa’an nasulitan ta izaw baluhay kalungangan a kasabelih.
maluman pyawti a kasabelih amiliyaw patatuzu’ kasabelih, payiza pisaungay baluhay pyawti a kasabelih.
pikinsa izaw haw ku [[Special:DoubleRedirects|hatusa miliyaw patatuzu’]] saca [[Special:BrokenRedirects|malepi’ay a miliyaw patatuzu’]] maydih misumad.
izaw kisu sikining ngay masasiket palalid payiza tatenga’ay a kakitizaan.

piazihen, amahica baluhayay a kasabelih kalungangan masaungay tuway, kyu tina kasabelih <strong> caay </strong> malimad tu zuma kakitizaan, anu caay baluhay kalungangan miliyaw patatuzu’ kasabelih zumasatu inayi’ amahicahica  mikawaway-kalumyiti nazipa’an.
mahiza sakamu, kapah kisu milimad mungangaw ta zuma kalungangan a kasabelih patiku ta saayaway kalungangan，uyzasa amana mitahpu amahicahica tu ayzaay kasabelih.

<strong> azihen: </strong>
tina saungay sakay manamuhay kasabelih hakay tadamaan atu talibahalay a sumad;
iayaw nu saungay kaluceki matineng kisu haw hakay kya teluc nay milimad.',
	'messages:movepagetalktext' => 'szy:amahica mipili’ tina atilad, mahizaay a sasukamu kasabelih amalunuk atu tina belih maladay milimad ta baluhay kakitizaan, ihekal sibaluhay kalungangan izawtu cacay muenengay sasukamu kasabelih.
uyniyay a pulita, amahica izaw siceyo kanca kisu lima-saungay milimad saca mikabu tu izaway a kasabelih.',
